Third-party rules in this directory
===================================

Rule packs that carry a "source" block contain data derived from the
projects below. evot's own packs (core.json, cn-cloud.json, personal.json)
are original; ideas taken from other projects are credited in the rule's
description in this file only and no code or data was copied from them:
Microsoft Presidio (MIT) and ByteDance GoDLP (MIT) for field-name and
context detection, Yelp detect-secrets (Apache-2.0) and gitleaks (MIT) for
false-positive filters, MongoDB Kingfisher (Apache-2.0) for offline
checksum verification. TruffleHog (AGPL-3.0) was not used.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------
betterleaks.json
  Generated by import_betterleaks.py from config/betterleaks.toml of
  Betterleaks, https://github.com/betterleaks/betterleaks (commit pinned in
  the pack's "source.commit"). Rules were reduced to their patterns,
  keywords, value groups, entropy floors and value discard lists.

secrets.json
  Patterns and false-positive checks ported from the internal/redact
  package of magpie, https://github.com/yetone/magpie

